Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:10.94,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:17.40,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.18,0:00:23.58,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:29.89,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:46.33,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.91,0:00:53.31,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:01:00.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:05.62,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:12.63,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.17,0:01:23.57,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.87,0:01:49.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.24,0:01:54.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都已经在战国时代念了书
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.27,0:01:56.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且一边听着犬夜叉的冷嘲热讽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.54,0:01:58.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特地跑回来的说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.25,0:02:01.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.35,0:02:02.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,写得顺吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:04.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.05,0:02:10.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天的考试很容易吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:11.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:22.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第69话 恐怖的无脸男人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.31,0:02:36.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.25,0:02:38.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和他进展如何了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.28,0:02:38.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.85,0:02:40.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.39,0:02:42.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个不良少年的他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.25,0:02:43.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是不良少年啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.59,0:02:45.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,劈腿的他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:48.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实他也不是劈腿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.83,0:02:50.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那要怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柏拉图…式的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.10,0:02:55.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柏拉图式的？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:57.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柏拉图式的劈腿？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:03:00.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再说劈腿了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:03.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 我之前就想跟你说了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.38,0:03:04.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.48,0:03:05.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙不太好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:07.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对呀 不太好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.85,0:03:09.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么突然这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.58,0:03:10.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是坏人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:11.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是坏人喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.32,0:03:12.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是坏人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:14.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么说是坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:16.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他又任性又粗鲁吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:18.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:20.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还会吃醋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:23.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道北条同学的事情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.13,0:03:27.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他应该不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.63,0:03:31.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么那家伙到底是在吃谁的醋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:32.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是钢牙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:34.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.94,0:03:39.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和钢牙没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:40.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.45,0:03:43.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他有什么理由要吃醋呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.88,0:03:44.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:48.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙说他迷恋我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:51.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇也劈腿？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:53.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.89,0:03:57.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有特别喜欢或讨厌钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:03:59.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:01.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇在我们不知道的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:03.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么有人缘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:05.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有人缘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:07.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙只是单方面的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.97,0:04:10.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是单方面也受到表白了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.24,0:04:11.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:14.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被某人说“我迷恋上你了”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:18.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.62,0:04:20.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷恋上你了~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.19,0:04:24.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.92,0:04:27.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是被这么说也就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.43,0:04:29.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还被别人问过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:31.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿不愿意帮他生孩子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:33.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是哪个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:34.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:36.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不良的他？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:38.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个都不是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.57,0:04:41.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第三个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:42.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:45.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会这么说绝对是年纪大的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.28,0:04:46.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他确实年纪比较大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:48.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他好像已经有心上人了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:49.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不伦之恋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样不好吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:53.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.59,0:04:55.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是不论碰到谁都会这么问的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:57.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:07.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为我生孩子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.67,0:05:12.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说真的什么事都没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.87,0:05:19.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是戈薇 怎么会跟这些人在一起呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:21.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 连现在的男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:22.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎都是不良少年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.11,0:05:25.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙好像也很强势
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:28.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样北条同学就没胜算了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.19,0:05:31.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇好像比较喜欢强势的类型吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:32.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.26,0:05:34.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是刚好这个情形
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.49,0:05:36.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你绝对会吃男生的亏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.06,0:05:39.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎会有个不幸的婚姻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.70,0:05:41.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再说些有的没的了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.33,0:05:42.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:43.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.33,0:05:45.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟那个不良少年 最近怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.84,0:05:46.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:48.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进展顺利吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.71,0:05:52.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺利…也没什么特别的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.28,0:05:54.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过没有问题就是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.51,0:05:55.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是很顺利嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.01,0:05:57.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是很喜欢他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:06:00.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 到此为止啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.22,0:06:01.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不该为你担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.99,0:06:04.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 随你高兴吧 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:07.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这样不是很好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:20.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:28.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算数考试 82分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.25,0:06:30.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很努力嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:32.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐 82分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:35.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好好 很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.55,0:06:39.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做什么啦 姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.39,0:06:42.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次以满分为目标努力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:43.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好难受
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.46,0:06:44.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了 到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.06,0:06:46.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:47.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.57,0:06:48.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.33,0:06:50.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.47,0:06:56.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.21,0:06:58.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那边有好好的吃饭吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.71,0:07:01.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,青菜或山菜等等
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:03.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本没有像这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.85,0:07:06.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就尽量的吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.22,0:07:08.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次什么时候要去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.22,0:07:11.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考试也结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.36,0:07:14.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先好好的睡个觉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:18.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天也去上课 之后再去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:22.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考试怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.93,0:07:24.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要问啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.50,0:07:26.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是没办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:29.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为戈薇在那边也很辛苦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:34.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.61,0:07:38.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.62,0:07:41.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.82,0:07:46.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道大家在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.09,0:07:50.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 管他的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:52.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:05.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇不在好寂寞喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.35,0:08:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 没什么不同吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.35,0:08:12.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骗人 我统统知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.98,0:08:15.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉常常发呆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.45,0:08:17.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是在想戈薇没错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:20.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙 你搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:24.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇说这次什么时候回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.60,0:08:29.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三…明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.20,0:08:32.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天就回来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:35.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们快点回村子迎接戈薇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:38.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我到处闻过了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.48,0:08:40.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是没有半点收获
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:42.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘不在的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.01,0:08:46.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在很难掌握四魂之玉的所在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:48.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连奈落的线索也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.02,0:08:51.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是能闻到那家伙的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.89,0:08:54.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就能找到他了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.04,0:09:14.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想出来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.65,0:09:19.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.43,0:09:34.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁？是弟弟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:37.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那和你们不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:39.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:54.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头目 这次要袭击哪个村子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:57.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论是酒或女人都很多的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.59,0:10:00.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:03.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:05.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头目 请您过来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.10,0:10:07.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.47,0:10:10.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.20,0:10:12.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是活的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.44,0:10:16.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真恶心 宰了它
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:17.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.11,0:10:22.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.85,0:10:30.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:31.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.99,0:10:34.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有…没有脸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.14,0:10:50.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.51,0:10:56.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有错吗 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.75,0:11:00.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这味道我怎么可能会弄错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.28,0:11:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这边
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.79,0:11:04.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的味道愈来愈浓了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.49,0:11:06.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落与人的血腥味
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:19.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都被杀光了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人是强盗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.04,0:11:24.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.14,0:11:26.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.01,0:11:31.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙的脸被剥走了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.65,0:11:32.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.68,0:11:33.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.39,0:11:35.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.79,0:11:39.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.79,0:11:41.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个人的脸都不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.89,0:11:44.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好诡异喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.90,0:11:48.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这太不寻常了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:50.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的杰作吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:52.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是为什么要对脸下手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.09,0:12:19.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪气的源头就是你吧 妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.23,0:12:25.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 这家伙竟然没有脸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.10,0:12:27.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双师父
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:29.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先退下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.71,0:12:30.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:34.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪 你从哪里来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:36.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从…哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.08,0:12:38.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:41.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何要做这么残酷的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.25,0:12:43.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脸…给我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.22,0:12:45.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脸？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.49,0:12:47.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为想要脸而杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.26,0:12:49.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可恶的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.73,0:12:51.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脸…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.73,0:12:53.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双师父
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:55.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要将你这邪恶的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.27,0:12:57.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铲除！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.24,0:12:58.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:02.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.16,0:13:30.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的脸 脸啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.82,0:13:52.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 这张脸不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.19,0:13:55.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无礼的家伙 我砍了你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.33,0:13:57.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然有了张不错的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.06,0:14:00.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还要把好刀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.57,0:14:03.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的刀看起来不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.44,0:14:08.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是好刀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.71,0:14:11.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.26,0:15:00.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.76,0:15:03.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不够
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.10,0:15:05.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要更多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.53,0:15:07.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要更多…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.26,0:15:09.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.28,0:15:23.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次就找那个村子下手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:27.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那村子…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.65,0:15:32.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.67,0:15:42.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:50.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:53.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到你了 臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.66,0:16:06.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.16,0:16:07.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.29,0:16:08.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要小心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.66,0:16:10.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己多保重呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.46,0:16:15.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次看都觉得不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.57,0:16:18.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么只有姐姐能去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.17,0:16:22.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能说这就是戈薇的命运吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:25.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了对了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.11,0:16:28.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了能让她随时都能回来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.31,0:16:29.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得去买点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:30.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.12,0:16:32.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.12,0:16:38.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:39.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.86,0:16:41.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少装蒜了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.26,0:16:43.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是奈落的分身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.43,0:16:45.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身上充满了那家伙的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.10,0:16:48.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我的事情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.53,0:16:50.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.87,0:16:51.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:54.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 看样子不是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.14,0:16:56.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该都是这家伙的杰作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.81,0:16:58.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确 这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:17:00.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散发出与奈落相同的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.45,0:17:03.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀害强盗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.65,0:17:05.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夺取脸的人就是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.18,0:17:07.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:10.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是每个都很粗糙所以不能用
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这个 还不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.56,0:17:15.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也是抢来的脸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.66,0:17:16.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.56,0:17:18.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是想要张不错的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:20.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钱和女人我统统都想要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.13,0:17:22.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我统统都试着去抢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:24.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是也不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.40,0:17:26.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有点不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:29.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 我到底想要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.57,0:17:30.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.41,0:17:32.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子他不是在开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.31,0:17:34.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连自己是谁都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.18,0:17:36.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和以前的奈落分身完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:47.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们果然碰面了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.89,0:17:49.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙是从我奈落身上诞生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.93,0:17:52.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最令人作呕的肉块
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.60,0:17:55.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 对你而言也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.37,0:17:58.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:18:00.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,袭击前面的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:01.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还放火烧了它的也是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.21,0:18:03.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.71,0:18:05.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来以为把人杀光
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:08.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎能让我想起什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.91,0:18:10.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但还是没用
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.21,0:18:12.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是很痛快而已
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:14.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:16.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了我想不起来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.62,0:18:21.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 叫无双如何
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.66,0:18:24.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫做无双 不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.20,0:18:28.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是给我这张脸的和尚的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.47,0:18:32.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你？是你杀了他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.24,0:18:36.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么嘴脸 有够碍眼的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.54,0:18:37.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.21,0:18:39.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:42.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得你的嘴脸很碍眼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.48,0:18:44.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 我们以前见过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.92,0:18:45.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:48.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再问下去也没有结果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:50.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:52.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散发奈落味道的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.26,0:18:54.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又胡乱的四处杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:56.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,砍死你的理由很充分了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:58.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试试看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.57,0:19:04.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.51,0:19:09.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.28,0:19:13.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:17.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.42,0:19:18.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.06,0:19:21.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仿佛是制造出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.80,0:19:29.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的毒虫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.05,0:19:43.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的手臂…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.55,0:19:47.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毒虫混入了他的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.45,0:19:50.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样我的风穴就不能用了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.33,0:19:54.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真厉害耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.06,0:19:57.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个村子里有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.56,0:19:59.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在胡扯什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:01.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个村子在呼唤着我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.50,0:20:02.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次只要将村人杀光
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.10,0:20:05.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎就能想起什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.47,0:20:06.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.35,0:20:12.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.12,0:20:18.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.35,0:20:21.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.53,0:20:28.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙蛮强的 小心一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.86,0:20:31.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 毕竟是奈落的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.27,0:20:32.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有啥了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.37,0:20:37.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.10,0:20:38.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.84,0:20:40.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:43.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.91,0:20:46.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:47.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.61,0:20:48.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.38,0:20:50.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我来迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:52.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别过来 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:54.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:01.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:03.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙是奈落的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.06,0:21:05.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你退到后面去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.67,0:21:12.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人…是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:15.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在发什么呆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.38,0:21:16.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:20.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 砍断了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.81,0:21:23.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 这是为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:25.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.15,0:21:29.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 是那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.42,0:21:31.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在自言自语什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.16,0:21:32.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一口气决胜负吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.69,0:21:33.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那女人 滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:35.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.73,0:21:36.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.37,0:21:39.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:42.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.57,0:21:44.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:48.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.71,0:21:49.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.21,0:21:54.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.75,0:21:57.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？这家伙是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.95,0:22:00.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是想得到这女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:20.34,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.14,0:22:27.17,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.98,0:22:33.94,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.72,0:22:40.96,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.20,0:22:47.23,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.67,0:22:54.10,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.91,0:23:01.14,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.95,0:23:07.72,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.42,0:23:14.73,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.20,0:23:21.23,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.00,0:23:28.00,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.74,0:23:34.44,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.99,0:23:48.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.16,0:23:50.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是奈落的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.26,0:23:51.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然连奈落的名字都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.90,0:23:54.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐告诉犬夜叉一行人 无双的下落
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.04,0:23:56.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在五十年前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.40,0:23:59.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗藏匿强盗鬼蜘蛛的洞窟里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.27,0:24:00.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞不好是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.27,0:24:02.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是去了应该能了解些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.54,0:24:05.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这段期间 奈落为了抹杀桔梗而行动
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.75,0:24:07.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.01,0:24:09.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再次苏醒的鬼蜘蛛记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.02,0:24:11.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五十年前的因缘
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.52,0:24:14.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一次就做个了断吧
